<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia's Phileo Land H1 net up.</title>
<headline>Malaysia's Phileo Land H1 net up.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to July 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		58.80	 vs	 20.29</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)    115.2	  vs	 75.2</p>
<p>    Operating revenue    200.90	 vs	114.68</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	  86.96	 vs	 30.55</p>
<p>Note: Company's full name is Phileo Land Bhd. It is involved in investment holding and property development.</p>
</text>
